usage: benchmark-flash-bridge.py [-h] [--mtp] [--dflash-draft DFLASH_DRAFT]
                                 [--dflash-mode {1,2,3}] [--compare]
                                 [--auto-cache | --cache-gib CACHE_GIB]
                                 [--prompt {MAIN,HOLD}] [--repeats REPEATS]
                                 [--tokens TOKENS] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                                 engine model output

Bounded Flash Next baseline/MTP campaign on two fixed prompts in one bridge.

positional arguments:
  engine
  model
  output

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mtp
  --dflash-draft DFLASH_DRAFT
  --dflash-mode {1,2,3}
  --compare             alternate baseline/MTP on the same binary
  --auto-cache          use the engine's automatic RAM budget
  --cache-gib CACHE_GIB
                        fixed expert RAM budget in GiB
  --prompt {MAIN,HOLD}  measure only this fixed prompt
  --repeats REPEATS     measured repetitions after warmup
  --tokens TOKENS
  --timeout TIMEOUT
